      "Html": "\u003Cstyle class=\u0022code-analysis-syntax\u0022\u003E\n.docs-content pre{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0 1.75rem;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;border:1px solid rgba(20,42,72,.16);border-left:4px solid #0e6fae;border-radius:4px;background:#f7fbfe;color:#10263a}\n.docs-content pre code{white-space:pre;color:inherit;background:transparent;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}\n.language-csharp .syntax-comment{color:#587287;font-style:italic}.language-csharp .syntax-string{color:#8a3d12}.language-csharp .syntax-keyword{color:#6542a6;font-weight:700}.language-csharp .syntax-number{color:#096b65}.language-csharp .syntax-type{color:#0a6680;font-weight:600}\n\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA service must declare TryCatch handling in an Exceptions partial.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhat the Standard says\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0026ldquo;Exceptions Mappings\u0026rdquo; \u0026mdash; Exception handling is isolated in a dedicated partial implementation so the main service operations remain readable. The exception boundary localizes dependency failures into exceptions meaningful to the service. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://github.com/hassanhabib/The-Standard/blob/master/2.%20Services/2.1%20Foundations/2.1%20Foundations.md#21321-exceptions-mappings\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003Eread it here\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhy it matters\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EException mapping is a protection concern rather than the business operation itself. A dedicated exceptions partial makes that boundary visible, keeps repetitive try/catch machinery out of the main service file, and gives every operation a consistent failure contract.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EBad code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Violates STX0009: A service must declare TryCatch handling in an Exceptions partial.\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentBroker\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker)\n    : \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(operation: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E () =\u0026gt;\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent);\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInsertStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E newStudent;\n        });\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eprivate\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estatic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFunc\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;\u0026gt; operation)\n    {\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Etry\u003C/span\u003E\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E operation();\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EArgumentException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceValidationException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInvalidOperationException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceDependencyException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n    }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EGood code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Follows STX0009\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentBroker\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker)\n    : \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(operation: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E () =\u0026gt;\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent);\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInsertStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E newStudent;\n        });\n}\n\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.Exceptions.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eprivate\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estatic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFunc\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;\u0026gt; operation)\n    {\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Etry\u003C/span\u003E\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E operation();\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EArgumentException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceValidationException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInvalidOperationException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceDependencyException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ecatch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EException\u003C/span\u003E innerException)\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ethrow\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Enew\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentServiceException\u003C/span\u003E(innerException);\n        }\n    }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E"
    }
